Package: kaption
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, kaption-common (= ${source:Version}), captiond, qt6-svg-plugins,
 qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs,
 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-window,
 qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript
Description: live captions for the Plasma desktop
 Kaption shows the computer's speech and optional microphone captions in a
 configurable overlay, with CEA-708 caption layout, readability checks and
 settled phrase announcements for screen readers. Recognition uses captiond
 and local Whisper models. Installing a model is an explicit action.
 .
 This package contains the Plasma frontend. No model is included.

Package: qaption
Section: x11
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, kaption-common (= ${source:Version}), captiond, qt6-svg-plugins,
 qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs,
 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-window,
 qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript
Description: Qt frontend for local live captions
 Qaption provides Kaption's captions and settings through a Qt frontend.
 Both frontends can be installed together and share the captiond service.
 This build retains the author's KI18n translation support and LayerShellQt
 overlay integration. No model is included.

Package: kaption-common
Section: kde
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: shared data for the Kaption and Qaption caption frontends
 Model catalogues, profanity word lists, logging metadata and the shared
 handbook used by the two frontends. This package contains no speech model.
